# Shell scripts and runit `run` files always run on Linux/Android (Termux) or Oracle Cloud,
# never on Windows - force LF regardless of the checkout machine's core.autocrlf. Without this, a
# Windows checkout silently converts them to CRLF, which then breaks bash parsing and shebang
# execution the moment the file is scp'd directly to the phone (hit in practice during TX-8's
# rollout on 2026-07-14 - see scripts/termux/README.md's gotchas).
*.sh text eol=lf
scripts/termux/service/*/run text eol=lf
